0013 1145 "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{2}} \\\\ {y}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={x}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {y}^{2}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {y}^{2}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{3}}{3} & =\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+K \\\\ {y}^{3} & ={x}^{3}+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=3K.$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n{y}^{3}={x}^{3}+C.\n$$" 13194139534470 true] [17592186290014 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290015 13194139534470 true] [17592186290014 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290016 13194139534470 true] [17592186290014 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290017 13194139534470 true] [17592186290014 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290018 13194139534470 true] [17592186290014 1000 #edb/ref 17592186290019 13194139534470 true] [17592186290014 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534470 true] [17592186290014 1041 "selection" 13194139534470 true] [17592186290014 1104 #edb/ref 17592186290016 13194139534470 true] [17592186290014 1110 #uuid "74271519-b18b-56ea-ac51-74907b249227" 13194139534470 true] [17592186290015 1034 "{y}^{3}=x+C" 13194139534470 true] [17592186290015 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534470 true] [17592186290015 1111 #uuid "7670e8de-1326-5f9f-9a9d-5c3b357abb06" 13194139534470 true] [17592186290016 1034 "{y}^{3}={x}^{3}+C" 13194139534470 true] [17592186290016 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534470 true] [17592186290016 1111 #uuid "e8d89319-5dec-5a29-9fe6-e628188e6e43" 13194139534470 true] [17592186290017 1034 "{y}^{2}={x}^{3}+C" 13194139534470 true] [17592186290017 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534470 true] [17592186290017 1111 #uu